sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Q as Quartz in MarketData (business days 18:30)
    participant MD as MarketData Service
    participant EXT as NBP / Stooq / CoinGecko
    participant MDB as marketdata_db
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant RP as Reporting Service
    participant PF as Portfolio Service
    participant RDB as reporting_db

    Q->>MD: trigger PriceSyncJob
    MD->>MDB: load active instruments and currencies
    MD->>EXT: fetch FX rates, gold, quotes, crypto
    EXT-->>MD: responses (JSON/CSV)
    Note over MD: retry with backoff (Polly)<br/>one failing source doesn't stop the rest
    MD->>MDB: UPSERT fx_rate, price_quote<br/>+ event written to OUTBOX (same transaction!)
    MDB-->>MD: commit
    MD->>MQ: publish DailyPricesSynced (from the outbox, after commit)

    MQ->>RP: deliver DailyPricesSynced
    RP->>RDB: check inbox (MessageId already processed?)
    alt new event
        RP->>PF: GET asset positions (internal REST)
        PF-->>RP: assets per portfolio
        RP->>MD: GET prices and rates for the day (REST)
        MD-->>RP: prices, rates
        RP->>RDB: INSERT valuation_snapshot + write to inbox
        Note over RP: no price for today → last known one,<br/>stale flag when > 7 days
    else duplicate
        RP->>RP: ignore (idempotency)
    end
